{"type":"message","id":"e33e7b9f","parentId":"d2a9b916","timestamp":"2026-04-11T13:57:23.902Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"231\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"567556397\",\n  \"sender\": \"Andrea Pitrone\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 13:57 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Andrea Pitrone (567556397)\",\n  \"id\": \"567556397\",\n  \"name\": \"Andrea Pitrone\",\n  \"username\": \"pitro_eng_guitarist\"\n}\n```\n\nHi, I’m feeling quite exhausted lately and I’ve started having this persistent, dull ache in my lower back on the right side. It’s been getting worse over the last few months. I’ve already sent you my EHR for the last 3 years and my DNA report."}],"timestamp":1775915843900}}
